file mantra/src/weave.rye the head and annotate's header repaired, and the head now enumerates Diff's fields
file tools/r/rye_struct_fields_witness.rish the Line and Diff placards moved forward with dated reasons
file tools/fixtures/m/mantra_weave_head_scan.sh diff_missing and diff_stale, gated at zero, told from operations by the parenthesis
