scope one fleet red closed in my own lane, two stale prose records repaired, the head reading widened to fields, and a control written for a scan that had none
status GREEN -- rye_struct_fields, mantra_weave_annotate with the head control at 17, seven other weave and diff witnesses, tame_style_check, and the three ledger guards all green on metal
